Figure 1. LC-DAD-MS analysis of a control strain and strains
carrying mpkAΔ and both mpkAΔ and pkfAΔ. (A) HPLC
profiles of extracts of strains as detected by UV absorbance at
254 nm. (B) Structures of compounds elucidated throughout
this study. The compounds are as follows: asperthecin, 1;
austinol, 2; dehydroaustinol, 3; sterigmatocystin, 4; emericellin,5;
shamixanthone, 6; epishamixanthone, 7; aspernidine A, 8;
aspernidine C, 9; aspernidine D, 10; aspernidine E, 11.
